{"_lintCache":"memo","_note":"review 组件的公开分支(合并包双源组件,doc/appstore-merged.md §5):该 App 在所选地区的最新一条公开评论。本文件由 tools/infosource/gen_appwatch.py 生成,改生成器别改这里(设计 doc/appstore-infosources-v2.md §8)。 ‖ _lintCache=memo(G23 契约5):唯一的写回是 aid_prelude 里「bundleId → Apple ID」映射 `c.aw.bid.*`,一旦写下就不会变;评论本身每次刷新都真取,不落盘。","i18n":{"zh-CN":{"errFetch":"取不到 App 信息"},"en-US":{"errFetch":"Couldn't load app info"}},"version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aidIn","value":"${appId}"},"_note":"目标 App 解析(四条流同一份,由 aid_prelude() 生成):空 appId 回落到关注列表第一个;只给 bundleId(ASC 跨包跳转)时 lookup?bundleId= 反查 trackId 并把映射记进 c.aw.bid.<bundleId>。下游一律用 ${aid}/${cc}。详见 doc/appstore-infosources-v2.md §8。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"bidIn","value":"${bundleId}"}},{"id":"wl","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"apps","default":[]}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aid0","value":"${wl[0].id}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ccIn","value":"${country}"}},{"id":"wlccRaw","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"country","default":""}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cnd","value":"$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"},"_note":"国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1):大陆渠道,或地区未知且界面中文。兼作 data.get 之后的屏障。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"wlcc","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${wlccRaw},if::(eq::(${cnd},1),CN,US))]"},"_note":"关注列表的地区设置;没设过 → 国内默认 CN、海外默认 US(海外中文用户也是 US)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cc0","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${ccIn},${wlcc})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hasBid","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bidIn},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"bmKey","value":"c.aw.bid.${bidIn}"}},{"id":"bm","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"${bmKey}","default":{}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"needR","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${aidIn},__none__),__none__),if::(eq::(${hasBid},1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${bm.id},__none__),__none__),1,0),0),0)]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${needR},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"id":"lb1","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/lookup?bundleId=${bidIn}&country=${cc0}","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ccAlt","value":"$[if::(eq::(${cc0},CN),US,CN)]"}},{"id":"lb2","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/lookup?bundleId=${bidIn}&country=${ccAlt}","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lbN1","value":"${lb1.results[0].trackName}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lbN2","value":"${lb2.results[0].trackName}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lbHit1","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${lbN1},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"lbHit2","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${lbN2},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${lbHit1},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"action":"data.set","params":{"key":"${bmKey}","value":{"id":"${lb1.results[0].trackId}","cc":"${cc0}"}}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${lbHit1},1),0,${lbHit2})]"},"items":[{"action":"data.set","params":{"key":"${bmKey}","value":{"id":"${lb2.results[0].trackId}","cc":"${ccAlt}"}}}]}],"_note":"只给 bundleId 且映射还没记过 → 反查一次(两个区各一次),命中即记下,之后不再联网。"},{"id":"bm2","action":"data.get","params":{"key":"${bmKey}","default":{}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aidB","value":"$[if::(eq::(${hasBid},1),findNotEmpty::(${bm2.id},),${aid0})]"},"_note":"给了 bundleId 却反查不到 → 留空(整页 --),**不能**回落到关注列表第一个:那是别人的数据。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aid","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${aidIn},${aidB})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"cc","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(${ccIn},findNotEmpty::(${bm2.cc},${wlcc}))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"LCM","value":{"US":"us","GB":"gb","JP":"jp","DE":"de","FR":"fr","CA":"ca","AU":"au","KR":"kr","BR":"br","CN":"cn"}},"_note":"评论 RSS 路径用小写地区码(规范写法;0 条是间歇性限流,见 reviews.df)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ccl","value":"$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${LCM},${cc}),${cc})]"}},{"action":"concurrent","items":[{"id":"lk","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/lookup?id=${aid}&country=${cc}","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"id":"rv","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/${ccl}/rss/customerreviews/id=${aid}/sortBy=mostRecent/json","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b1","value":"1"},"_note":"屏障(勿删)。"},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${lk.resultCount},__NA__),__NA__),1,0)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"${@i18n.errFetch}"}}],"_note":"lookup 信封缺失 = 没拿到答案 → 抛错,宿主回落上一帧(widget-states)。评论 RSS 0 条不算失败。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"name","value":"${lk.results[0].trackName}"},"_note":"App 名自由文本,明文直取。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pNRv","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${rv.feed.entry[0].title.label}),0),1,0)]"},"_note":"有没有评论:取第一条的标题判(RSS 只有一条时 entry 是对象不是数组,两种形态这里都取得到)。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pRt","value":"$[parseNumber::(${rv.feed.entry[0].im:rating.label},0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pStars","value":"$[if::(ge::(${pRt},5),★★★★★,if::(ge::(${pRt},4),★★★★,if::(ge::(${pRt},3),★★★,if::(ge::(${pRt},2),★★,if::(ge::(${pRt},1),★,)))))]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pLow","value":"$[if::(le::(${pRt},2),if::(ge::(${pRt},1),1,0),0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pTt","value":"${rv.feed.entry[0].title.label}"},"_note":"自由文本明文直取。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pBody","value":"${rv.feed.entry[0].content.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pHasTt","value":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${pTt}),0),1,0)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pNick","value":"${rv.feed.entry[0].author.name.label}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pTer","value":"${cc}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pUp","value":"$[parseDate::(subString::(${rv.feed.entry[0].updated.label},0,10),yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"today","value":"$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pDays","value":"$[if::(ge::(${pUp},1),round::(calc::((${today}-${pUp})/86400000),0),)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pPend","value":"0"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pFail","value":"0"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"pHasApp","value":"$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${aid},__none__),__none__),0,1)]"},"_note":"有没有对象 App(参数或关注列表第一个)。没有 → 组件写「还没选 App」,不写「这个地区没有评论」。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"at","value":"$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},HH:mm)]"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["name","at","pNRv","pRt","pStars","pLow","pTt","pBody","pHasTt","pNick","pTer","pDays","pPend","pFail","pHasApp"]}}]}
